00:10:43.342 --> 00:10:46.312
crypto traders, hedge fund billionaires,

00:10:46.912 --> 00:10:49.382
saving taxpayers billions of dollars

00:10:50.316 --> 00:10:52.385
Republicans, Republicans defended

00:10:52.752 --> 00:10:53.552
every single

00:10:53.552 --> 00:10:55.921
one of these special interest loopholes.

00:10:55.921 --> 00:10:57.790
Every single one.

00:10:57.790 --> 00:10:59.692
But I'm going to be coming back

00:10:59.692 --> 00:11:02.028
And with your help, I'm going to win

00:11:02.028 --> 00:11:03.462
