lower the temperature

00:12:01.353 --> 00:12:03.389
at work together to pursue progress,

00:12:04.090 --> 00:12:05.825
secure prosperity

00:12:05.825 --> 00:12:07.460
and keep the promise

00:12:07.460 --> 00:12:09.929
