00:12:09.929 --> 00:12:12.565
As I've said, my inaugural address

00:12:12.565 --> 00:12:14.800
without unity,

00:12:14.800 --> 00:12:17.002
there is no peace with bitterness.

00:12:17.002 --> 00:12:19.438
And shooter and fury.

00:12:19.438 --> 00:12:22.475
And we can never become that country.

00:12:22.475 --> 00:12:24.376
I can honestly say

00:12:24.376 --> 00:12:26.145
I can honestly say tonight

00:12:26.145 --> 00:12:27.613
that I've never been more optimistic

00:12:27.613 --> 00:12:29.548
